{"k":{"t01-apar-0":"<span class=\"ln\" data-korpo=\"12.6pt\" data-rolo=\"sekc\">SELETUSVIHIK</span> <span class=\"ln\" data-korpo=\"8.4pt\" data-rolo=\"sekc\">TEOSELE</span> <span class=\"ln lg\" data-korpo=\"15.6pt\" data-rolo=\"sekc\">Delmas’i abitabelid</span> <span class=\"orn\">❦</span> <span class=\"ln\" data-korpo=\"13.2pt\" data-rolo=\"serio\">ESIMENE SEERIA</span> <span class=\"fil\"></span>","t01-apar-1":"<span class=\"ln lg\" data-korpo=\"15.0pt\" data-rolo=\"nom\">TABEL Nr. 1</span> <span class=\"ln lg\" data-korpo=\"11.4pt\" data-rolo=\"tit\">Kool. — Gümnaasium. — Klassiruum.</span> <span class=\"fil\"></span>","t01-tit-1":"<span class=\"pk\" data-korpo=\"10.2pt\" data-rolo=\"sekc\">Üldine kirjeldus.</span>","t01-01-1":"1. — See tabel kujutab <b>gümnaasiumi</b> <b>klassiruumi</b>. Selles klassiruumis on kaheksa <b>lauda</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.339325,0.560105,0.009987,0.010154\" data-n=\"18\" title=\"lauda\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(18)</sup></button> ja kaheksa <b>pinki</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.298491,0.886341,0.009543,0.012447\" data-n=\"32\" title=\"pinki\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(32)</sup></button>. Igal pingil istub kolm õpilast. <b>Õpetaja</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.104527,0.503767,0.004882,0.010481\" data-n=\"7\" title=\"Õpetaja\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(7)</sup></button> istub <b>toolil</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.072792,0.542745,0.00466,0.012119\" data-n=\"8\" title=\"toolil\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(8)</sup></button> oma <b>kateedri</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.134043,0.602358,0.00466,0.011137\" data-n=\"6\" title=\"kateedri\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(6)</sup></button> taga.","t01-02-1":"2. — Kateedrist vasakul on <b>kapp</b> klaasustega <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.188859,0.618736,0.008877,0.010481\" data-n=\"15\" title=\"füüsika\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(15)</sup></button>. Paremal on <b>must tahvel</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.016644,0.59679,0.003329,0.010481\" data-n=\"1\" title=\"must tahvel\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(1)</sup></button> koos <b>lapiga</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.034842,0.685228,0.005548,0.010154\" data-n=\"2\" title=\"lapiga\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(2)</sup></button> ja <b>kriidiga</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.055704,0.744186,0.004882,0.010481\" data-n=\"3\" title=\"kriidiga\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(3)</sup></button>.","t01-02-2":"Kateedri kohal ripuvad <b>seinatahvlid</b> <sup>(<button class=\"lupo nuda\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.042166,0.4887,0.00466,0.010481\" data-n=\"9\" title=\"seinatahvlid\" aria-expanded=\"false\">9</button>, <button class=\"lupo nuda\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.097426,0.279725,0.007767,0.010481\" data-n=\"11\" title=\"seinatahvlid\" aria-expanded=\"false\">11</button>, <button class=\"lupo nuda\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.170883,0.311824,0.009099,0.010481\" data-n=\"12\" title=\"seinatahvlid\" aria-expanded=\"false\">12</button>)</sup> ja <b>kaart</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.117843,0.250901,0.009099,0.010481\" data-n=\"10\" title=\"kaart\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(10)</sup></button>.","t01-03-1":"3. — Mitte kõik õpilased ei istu oma <b>kohal</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.290945,0.528005,0.011096,0.010809\" data-n=\"17\" title=\"kohal\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(17)</sup></button>. Jaan <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.006658,0.712414,0.00577,0.010481\" data-n=\"4\" title=\"\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(4)</sup></button> seisab tahvli juures; ta hoiab lappi ja kustutab <b>geomeetrilisi kujundeid</b>.","t01-03-2":"Peeter on kateedri lähedal; ta kogub <b>kirjalikke töid</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.092543,0.64756,0.005104,0.010809\" data-n=\"5\" title=\"kirjalikke töid\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(5)</sup></button> ja viib need õpetajale.","t01-04-1":"4. — <b>See</b> õpetaja on <b>elavate keelte</b> õpetaja. Ta õpetab õpilasi rääkima, lugema ja kirjutama võõrkeeli <b>(saksa, inglise, hispaania, itaalia, vene</b> või <b>prantsuse)</b>.","t01-05-1":"5. — Klassiruum on väga avar ja väga valge. Tagaseinas on lai <b>aken</b>, kaks <b>tuulutusakent</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.336662,0.236489,0.010209,0.010481\" data-n=\"78\" title=\"tuulutusakent\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(78)</sup></button> ja <b>klaasuks</b> selle õhutamiseks ja valgustamiseks.","t01-05-2":"See klassiruum ei ole külm. Keskel on selle soojendamiseks väga hea <b>ahi</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.543054,0.73567,0.011984,0.010809\" data-n=\"46\" title=\"ahi\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(46)</sup></button> oma <b>toruga</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.506214,0.622666,0.010431,0.011464\" data-n=\"45\" title=\"toruga\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(45)</sup></button>.","t01-05-3":"Seina külge on kinnitatud <b>riidenagid</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.908566,0.720275,0.009543,0.011464\" data-n=\"58\" title=\"riidenagid\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(58)</sup></button>; nende otsas ripuvad õpilaste mütsid ja mantlid.","t01-tit-2":"<span class=\"pk\" data-korpo=\"10.2pt\" data-rolo=\"sekc\">Mänguõu.</span>","t01-06-1":"6. — <b>Kell</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.781846,0.21225,0.010874,0.010481\" data-n=\"63\" title=\"Kell\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(63)</sup></button> näitab üheksa ja viis minutit.","t01-06-2":"<b>Vahetund</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.38016,0.384212,0.010874,0.010481\" data-n=\"76\" title=\"Vahetund\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(76)</sup></button> on just lõppenud ja tund algab uuesti. Vahetund peetakse <b>õues</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.36285,0.442516,0.008655,0.010154\" data-n=\"75\" title=\"õues\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(75)</sup></button>. Me näeme mõnda mängivat õpilast. <b>Kasvataja</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.419441,0.372093,0.011318,0.010481\" data-n=\"74\" title=\"Kasvataja\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(74)</sup></button> valvab neid.","t01-07-1":"7. — Õues näeme veel teisi inimesi: <b>inspektorit</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.400355,0.432689,0.010652,0.010481\" data-n=\"73\" title=\"inspektorit\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(73)</sup></button>, <b>direktorit</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.47692,0.431379,0.008655,0.010809\" data-n=\"71\" title=\"direktorit\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(71)</sup></button> ja <b>õppealajuhatajat</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.441411,0.428431,0.010652,0.010481\" data-n=\"72\" title=\"õppealajuhatajat\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(72)</sup></button>.","t01-07-2":"Inspektor kontrollib koole, direktor juhib gümnaasiumi, õppealajuhataja valvab õppetööd.","t01-07-3":"Neljas isik on <b>uksehoidja</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.33644,0.429414,0.010652,0.010481\" data-n=\"77\" title=\"uksehoidja\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(77)</sup></button>. Ta kannab kaenla all päevikut, kuhu märkida puudujad.","t01-08-1":"8. — Õue tagaosas on <b>võimlemisriistad</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.467599,0.393384,0.009543,0.009826\" data-n=\"70\" title=\"võimlemisriistad\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(70)</sup></button> ja <b>käsitöö</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.559698,0.471995,0.010874,0.010481\" data-n=\"69\" title=\"käsitöö\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(69)</sup></button> töökoda.","t01-08-2":"Tabelist paremal hakkame nägema <b>muusika</b>- ja <b>joonistusruume</b>.","t01-tit-3":"<span class=\"pk\" data-korpo=\"10.2pt\" data-rolo=\"sekc\">Üksikasjalik kirjeldus.</span>","t01-tit-4":"<span class=\"pk\" data-korpo=\"10.2pt\" data-rolo=\"sekc\">Head õpilased.</span>","t01-09-1":"9. — Kateedrist paremal esimeses pingis istuvad <b>Henrik</b> <button class=\"apel\" data-noto=\"et-t01-noto-1\" aria-expanded=\"false\">(*)</button>, <b>Stefan</b> ja <b>Kaarel</b>.","t01-09-2":"Henrik on väga tähelepanelik ja töökas; ta kuulab õpetajat. Tema laual on <b>vihik</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.230581,0.868981,0.010209,0.011464\" data-n=\"28\" title=\"vihik\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(28)</sup></button>, <b>raamat</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.199068,0.863085,0.010209,0.010481\" data-n=\"29\" title=\"raamat\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(29)</sup></button>, <b>sõnaraamat</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.159565,0.891582,0.010874,0.011137\" data-n=\"30\" title=\"sõnaraamat\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(30)</sup></button> ja <b>pinal</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.214603,0.905011,0.009543,0.011137\" data-n=\"31\" title=\"pinal\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(31)</sup></button>. Tema raamatul on palju <b>lehekülgi</b>; igas peatükis on mitu <b>lõiku</b> ja igal <b>real</b> palju <b>sõnu</b>.","t01-09-4":"Tema naaber Stefan <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.291389,0.81035,0.012206,0.010154\" data-n=\"24\" title=\"\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(24)</sup></button> on hoolas. Ta märgib oma vihikusse järgmise korra õppetüki. Tal on ilus <b>käekiri</b>. Tema raamat on suletud. Me näeme ainult <b>kaant</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.201287,0.804455,0.010431,0.010809\" data-n=\"27\" title=\"kaant\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(27)</sup></button>. Tema kõrval on <b>sirkel</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.21771,0.820832,0.010874,0.010809\" data-n=\"26\" title=\"sirkel\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(26)</sup></button>.","t01-09-5":"Kaarel <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.270084,0.730102,0.009987,0.011137\" data-n=\"23\" title=\"\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(23)</sup></button> hoiab raamatut käes; ta avab selle, et õppetükki üle korrata. Nagu igal õpilasel on temal enda ees <b>tindipott</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.241456,0.717982,0.011318,0.009826\" data-n=\"25\" title=\"tindipott\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(25)</sup></button>. Ta on sõnakuulelik.","t01-10-1":"10. — Kõrvallauas istuvad <b>Ludvig, Anton</b> ja <b>Paul</b>. Ludvig vastab oma <b>õppetükki</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.365291,0.645922,0.010652,0.010481\" data-n=\"22\" title=\"õppetükki\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(22)</sup></button> ja vastab õpetaja <b>küsimustele</b>. Anton <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.329117,0.630855,0.009099,0.010481\" data-n=\"21\" title=\"\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(21)</sup></button> on väga tähelepanematu; mõnikord õpetaja isegi karistab teda. Paul <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.334665,0.600721,0.010874,0.010809\" data-n=\"20\" title=\"\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(20)</sup></button> on hea <b>kaaslane</b>, lahke ja abivalmis. Ta on väga tähelepanelik.","t01-tit-5":"<span class=\"pk\" data-korpo=\"10.2pt\" data-rolo=\"sekc\">Halvad õpilased.</span>","t01-11-1":"11. — Henriku taga istub <b>Jüri</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.543276,0.87455,0.010209,0.010481\" data-n=\"38\" title=\"Jüri\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(38)</sup></button>. Ta ei ole halb poiss, kuid ta on <b>lobisev</b>, tähelepanematu ja rahutu. Tema <b>kergemeelsus</b> ja <b>sõnakuulmatus</b> tekitavad tunnis <b>korratust</b> ja sageli teenib ta karmi <b>hoiatuse</b>. Tema <b>mustandivihik</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.486906,0.885686,0.009987,0.010809\" data-n=\"35\" title=\"mustandivihik\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(35)</sup></button> on räpane, ta teeb sinna <b>tindiplekke</b> oma <b>sulepeaga</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.513316,0.936456,0.011762,0.008516\" data-n=\"34\" title=\"sulepeaga\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(34)</sup></button>, ja seepärast kasutab ta alati oma <b>kustutuskummi</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.478695,0.859155,0.010874,0.011137\" data-n=\"36\" title=\"kustutuskummi\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(36)</sup></button>; tema <b>portfell</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.454949,0.912217,0.010431,0.012119\" data-n=\"33\" title=\"portfell\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(33)</sup></button> on rebenenud, sest ta on väga hooletu. Miks ta toob oma <b>pliiatsihoidja</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.496671,0.864723,0.009987,0.010481\" data-n=\"37\" title=\"pliiatsihoidja\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(37)</sup></button> elavate keelte tundi?","t01-11-2":"Tema naaber Edmund <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.53573,0.800852,0.010209,0.010481\" data-n=\"39\" title=\"\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(39)</sup></button> ei salli teda. Ta on tõesti pisut laisk, kuid ta on vaikne ja püsib rahulikult. Ta ei lobise; ainult et kuulamise asemel eelistab ta lugeda oma <b>lugemiku</b> <b>jutte</b>.","t01-11-3":"Selle pingi kolmas õpilane on <b>Ludvig</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.483577,0.767114,0.011096,0.010809\" data-n=\"40\" title=\"Ludvig\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(40)</sup></button>. Ta on hoolas. Ta kirjutab valgele <b>paberilehele</b>. Enda ette on ta pannud oma <b>kuivatuspaberi</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.432091,0.739928,0.009099,0.010481\" data-n=\"41\" title=\"kuivatuspaberi\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(41)</sup></button>.","t01-12-1":"12. — Teise pingi õpilased, õpetajast vasakul, on väga noored. Esimene, väike <b>Emil</b>, ei oska veel hästi kirjutada; ta toob kaasa oma <b>krihvlitahvli</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.45162,0.655421,0.011318,0.010481\" data-n=\"42\" title=\"krihvlitahvli\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(42)</sup></button>, oma <b>krihvli</b> ja oma <b>käsna</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.437195,0.627252,0.011096,0.010809\" data-n=\"43\" title=\"käsna\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(43)</sup></button>.","t01-12-2":"Tema kõrval istuvad <b>August</b> ja <b>Bernard</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.437195,0.591549,0.011984,0.009499\" data-n=\"44\" title=\"Bernard\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(44)</sup></button>. See viimane töötab hästi, kuid tema <b>riietus</b> on väga hooletu.","t01-13-1":"13. — Nende taga istub kolm <b>laiska. Albert</b> ei õpi oma õppetükke. <b>Jaakob</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.629161,0.611857,0.010874,0.010809\" data-n=\"47\" title=\"Jaakob\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(47)</sup></button> magab kuulamise asemel. Tema <b>laiskus</b> toob talle <b>etteheiteid</b> ja isegi <b>karistusi</b>. Lõpuks on <b>Kristjan</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.679982,0.61153,0.009987,0.010154\" data-n=\"48\" title=\"Kristjan\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(48)</sup></button> liiga kergemeelne. Ta <b>käitub</b> halvasti ega tee mingit pingutust, et end parandada.","t01-14-1":"14. — Tema naabrid seevastu käituvad hästi. <b>Ernst</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.699956,0.702588,0.007989,0.010809\" data-n=\"51\" title=\"Ernst\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(51)</sup></button> armastab <b>korda</b> ja <b>korralikkust</b>; ta kasutab alati oma <b>joonlauda</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.692632,0.793318,0.008877,0.010809\" data-n=\"50\" title=\"joonlauda\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(50)</sup></button> ja oma <b>pliiatsit</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.671993,0.744841,0.010209,0.009171\" data-n=\"49\" title=\"pliiatsit\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(49)</sup></button>. Ta on <b>päevaõpilane</b>.","t01-14-2":"<b>Frants</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.780293,0.754012,0.009543,0.011137\" data-n=\"52\" title=\"Frants\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(52)</sup></button> on <b>internaadiõpilane</b>; ta kannab gümnaasiumi <b>vormiriietust</b>; ta sööb ja magab seal. Ta on hea <b>kaaslane</b>.","t01-14-3":"Moritz teritab oma <b>pliiatsit</b> oma <b>taskunoaga</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.786951,0.886341,0.010431,0.010481\" data-n=\"56\" title=\"taskunoaga\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(56)</sup></button>; ta on väga hoolikas.","t01-14-4":"Ta toob kaasa kõik oma raamatud, oma <b>grammatika</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.732801,0.892892,0.009543,0.010481\" data-n=\"55\" title=\"grammatika\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(55)</sup></button>, oma <b>märkmiku</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.709055,0.857845,0.011096,0.010481\" data-n=\"54\" title=\"märkmiku\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(54)</sup></button> ja isegi <b>kirjutusaluse</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.762761,0.880118,0.010209,0.010481\" data-n=\"53\" title=\"kirjutusaluse\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(53)</sup></button>. Tema <b>koolikott</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.930537,0.91451,0.010209,0.010809\" data-n=\"57\" title=\"koolikott\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(57)</sup></button> on põrandal tema taga.","t01-14-5":"Klassiruumi tagumist kahte lauda hõivavad <b>head õpilased</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.337772,0.507042,0.008433,0.010809\" data-n=\"19\" title=\"head õpilased\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(19)</sup></button>.","t01-tit-6":"<span class=\"pk\" data-korpo=\"10.2pt\" data-rolo=\"sekc\">Joonistamine ja muusika.</span>","t01-15-1":"15. — <b>Joonistusklassis</b> on ilusad <b>mudelid</b> seina küljes ja <b>lamp</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.975144,0.45922,0.009765,0.010809\" data-n=\"62\" title=\"lamp\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(62)</sup></button> <b>lambivarjuga</b>, mis ripub lae küljes. <b>Õpetaja</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.81447,0.575827,0.009543,0.011464\" data-n=\"60\" title=\"Õpetaja\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(60)</sup></button> on väga kannatlik; ta parandab õpilaste <b>joonistusi</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.891034,0.610219,0.007324,0.009826\" data-n=\"61\" title=\"joonistusi\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(61)</sup></button> ja õpetab neid natuurist <b>büsti</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.976476,0.514248,0.009987,0.010481\" data-n=\"59\" title=\"büsti\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(59)</sup></button> joonistama.","t01-16-1":"16. — <b>Muusikaklass</b> tundub väga huvitav. Seal õpitakse <b>muusikat</b> lugema, solfedžeerima <b>gamminoote</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.753884,0.423845,0.011096,0.010481\" data-n=\"67\" title=\"gamminoote\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(67)</sup></button>, mis on kirjutatud <b>noodijoonestikule</b> (do, re, mi, fa, sol, la, si = C. D. E. F. G. A. B.), tundma <b>võtmeid</b> ja laulma kauneid <b>meloodiaid</b>. Noodid pannakse <b>noodipuldile</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.640257,0.466099,0.010431,0.010481\" data-n=\"65\" title=\"noodipuldile\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(65)</sup></button>. Üks õpilastest <b>mängib klaverit</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.758766,0.510645,0.010652,0.010809\" data-n=\"64\" title=\"mängib klaverit\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(64)</sup></button> ja <b>muusikaõpetaja</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.699512,0.461513,0.009099,0.010809\" data-n=\"66\" title=\"muusikaõpetaja\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(66)</sup></button> <b>lööb takti</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.725477,0.447101,0.010431,0.010481\" data-n=\"68\" title=\"lööb takti\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(68)</sup></button>.","t01-17-1":"17. — Me hakkame nägema nurka <b>käsitöö</b> <b>töökojast</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.559698,0.471995,0.010874,0.010481\" data-n=\"69\" title=\"käsitöö\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(69)</sup></button>, kus poisid võivad õppida puitu hööveldama ja rauda viilima. Seda ei ole igas gümnaasiumis.","t01-tit-7":"<span class=\"pk\" data-korpo=\"10.2pt\" data-rolo=\"sekc\">Loodusteaduste klass.</span>","t01-18-1":"18. — Matemaatikaõpetaja õpetab õpilastele <b>geomeetriat, aritmeetikat, arvutamist</b> ja <b>meetermõõdustikku</b>. Me näeme tabelil peamisi geomeetrilisi kujundeid: <b>ring</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.019633,0.658661,0.0071,0.01048\" data-n=\"a\" title=\"ring\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(a)</sup></button>, <b>ruut</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.052468,0.626557,0.0071,0.01048\" data-n=\"b\" title=\"ruut\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(b)</sup></button>, <b>kolmnurk</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.049811,0.67077,0.0071,0.01048\" data-n=\"c\" title=\"kolmnurk\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(c)</sup></button>, <b>joon</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.035173,0.739874,0.0071,0.01048\" data-n=\"d\" title=\"joon\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(d)</sup></button>.","t01-18-2":"Me näeme ka üht <b>tehet</b>; see ei ole <b>liitmine</b> ega <b>lahutamine</b> ega <b>korrutamine</b>: see on <b>jagamine</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.065565,0.676005,0.0071,0.01048\" data-n=\"e\" title=\"jagamine\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(e)</sup></button>.","t01-19-1":"19. — Meetermõõdustiku tabelil eristame: <b>meetrit</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.052217,0.380286,0.0071,0.01048\" data-n=\"a\" title=\"meetrit\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(a)</sup></button>, <b>kaalu</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.015161,0.379639,0.0071,0.01048\" data-n=\"b\" title=\"kaalu\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(b)</sup></button> ja selle <b>vihte</b>, <b>liitrit</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.059978,0.343932,0.0071,0.01048\" data-n=\"e\" title=\"liitrit\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(e)</sup></button>, <b>dekaliitrit</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.013372,0.258796,0.0071,0.01048\" data-n=\"f\" title=\"dekaliitrit\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(f)</sup></button>, <b>detsiliitrit</b> ja <b>kuupmeetrit</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.03224,0.324944,0.0071,0.01048\" data-n=\"d\" title=\"kuupmeetrit\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(d)</sup></button>.","t01-19-2":"Õpilased õpivad ka <b>loodusteadusi</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.097426,0.279725,0.007767,0.010481\" data-n=\"11\" title=\"seinatahvlid\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(11)</sup></button> — zooloogiat <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.124098,0.290533,0.0071,0.01048\" data-n=\"a\" title=\"zooloogiat\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(a)</sup></button>, botaanikat <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.132317,0.3652,0.0071,0.01048\" data-n=\"b\" title=\"botaanikat\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(b)</sup></button>, geoloogiat <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.127443,0.431354,0.0071,0.01048\" data-n=\"c\" title=\"geoloogiat\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(c)</sup></button> — ja <b>ajalugu</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.170883,0.311824,0.009099,0.010481\" data-n=\"12\" title=\"seinatahvlid\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(12)</sup></button>.","t01-19-3":"Kapis on <b>füüsika</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.188859,0.618736,0.008877,0.010481\" data-n=\"15\" title=\"füüsika\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(15)</sup></button> ja <b>keemia</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.230138,0.5755,0.009321,0.010481\" data-n=\"16\" title=\"keemia\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(16)</sup></button> riistad.","t01-19-4":"Kapi peal on: <b>kera</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.189525,0.419915,0.009987,0.010481\" data-n=\"14\" title=\"kera\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(14)</sup></button>, <b>koonus</b> ja <b>maakera</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.175322,0.387815,0.010209,0.011464\" data-n=\"13\" title=\"maakera\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(13)</sup></button>.","t01-19-5":"Tahvlite kohal ripub <b>kaart</b>, mis kujutab maailma viit jagu: <b>Euroopat</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.161802,0.143808,0.0071,0.01048\" data-n=\"e\" title=\"Euroopat\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(e)</sup></button>, <b>Aasiat</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.20951,0.166394,0.0071,0.01048\" data-n=\"g\" title=\"Aasiat\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(g)</sup></button>, <b>Aafrikat</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.155821,0.230267,0.0071,0.01048\" data-n=\"f\" title=\"Aafrikat\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(f)</sup></button>, <b>Ameerikat</b> <sup>(<button class=\"lupo nuda\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.073486,0.101258,0.0071,0.01048\" data-n=\"a\" title=\"Ameerikat\" aria-expanded=\"false\">a</button><button class=\"lupo nuda\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.084585,0.148741,0.0071,0.01048\" data-n=\"b\" title=\"Ameerikat\" aria-expanded=\"false\">b</button>)</sup> ja <b>Okeaaniat</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.209077,0.256781,0.0071,0.01048\" data-n=\"h\" title=\"Okeaaniat\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(h)</sup></button>, ning kaht suurt ookeani, <b>Vaikset</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.036213,0.146461,0.0071,0.01048\" data-n=\"c\" title=\"Vaikset\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(c)</sup></button> ja <b>Atlandi</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.116538,0.161832,0.0071,0.01048\" data-n=\"d\" title=\"Atlandi\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(d)</sup></button>. <span class=\"fil\"></span>"},"noto":{"t01-noto-1":"(*) <i>Ristinimede</i> puhul soovitatakse need kirjutada ka ladinapärasel kujul. See on ainus viis vältida loendamatuid erikujusid. Kuidas muidu valida <i>Giovanni, Jean,</i> <i>Johann, Jan, Hans, John, Ivan</i> jne. vahel? Kas me loome ristinimede jaoks eraldi sõnaraamatu? Võtkem ladina keelest nende nimetav kääne ja öelgem: <b>Ioannes, Ioanna; Iulius, Iulia; Iakobus; Andreas; Lukas.</b> (Täielik grammatika)."}}
